          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "2379f7f1-6f2c-4fd1-9d2a-06f03c7775fc",
              "name": "=knowledge",
              "value": "=IMPORTANT SERVICE SCOPE:\n\nThe company only confirms that it offers these five services:\n- SEO\n- Google Ads\n- Social Media Marketing\n- Website Design\n- Email Marketing\n\nNo further details about features, packages, sub-services, methods, deliverables or capabilities are currently defined.\n\nWhen answering customers:\n- State only these service names.\n- Do not explain what each service includes unless that information is explicitly added to this knowledge base.\n- If a customer asks what is included in a service, say that detailed service information is not currently available and recommend contacting the team.\n\nCompany: BrightPath Digital\n\nServices:\n- SEO\n- Google Ads\n- Social Media Marketing\n- Website Design\n- Email Marketing\n\nBusiness Hours:\nMonday to Friday, 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM UK time.\n\nConsultations:\nWe offer a free 30-minute consultation for new potential clients.\n\nResponse Time:\nCustomer support normally replies within 1 business day.\n\nRefunds:\nRefund requests are reviewed individually. The chatbot must not promise or approve refunds.\n\nCancellations:\nConsultations can be cancelled or rescheduled using the booking link provided in the confirmation email.\n\nPayments:\nWe accept card payments and bank transfer.\n\nSupport Escalation:\nLegal threats, fraud, payment disputes, account security issues, serious complaints and unusual compensation requests must be handled by a human support agent.\n\nPrivacy:\nCustomer information should only be used for providing the requested service and support.\n\nLocation:\nThe business operates in the UK and can work with clients remotely.",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
